# Extracted from res://scripts/chapter2/ch2_arena_district.gd
# Source material for the rewrite; not loaded by the game.
# Format: story/DIALOGUE_FORMAT.md

~ _show_tier_selection
Vex: Welcome to the arena! Pick your tier, fighter!
Vex: You're not ready for any tier yet! Go train some more!
Vex: Starting %s tier! %d waves of combat! Ready?

~ _on_arena_victory
Vex: Not bad, newcomer! Not bad at all! But someone VERY important wants to have a word with you...
Vex: Want another round? Press SPACE to fight again, or ESC to head back to the city.

~ _grant_bronze_arena_material_reward
Vex: Bronze tier spoils! Torval asked me to pass along a chunk of Data Ore. Survive the arena, improve your kit, come back louder.
System: [ARENA MATERIAL]\nReceived: Data Ore x1

~ _on_arena_defeat
Vex: Tough break, fighter. But every loss makes you stronger! Press SPACE to try again or ESC to leave!
